{
  "about": [
    "What building a derivation amounts to, as two programs must agree:",
    "Yukimi's update check (kind in crates/yukimi-system/src/preflight.rs), which asks before an update that compiles,",
    "and the nightly's coverage gate (kind in scripts/check_cache_coverage.py), which keeps such an update off nightly.",
    "Both run every case here, and each checks that every compiler and every runtime-library output it knows",
    "has a case, so neither changes alone.",
    "The first cases are `nix derivation show` on Determinate Nix 3.24.2 for a Sekka system's update on 2026-11-24,",
    "each derivation reduced to the fields read and a few of its inputs. The cases after them are made up."
